* Capture a {i:Gauger Plate|Gauger Plate|2480} from any {p:Notorious Monster} in Abyssea.
* Return the plate to {p:Ken (A)} for your reward.

__Zoning is not required to repeat this quest, but it is limited to one completion per Vana'diel day.__
